1
00:00:04,625 --> 00:00:05,375
What?!

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,750
Godfather, I will destroy you!

3
00:00:16,875 --> 00:00:18,000
My lord, what happened?

4
00:00:19,625 --> 00:00:21,666
In one hour,

5
00:00:21,666 --> 00:00:23,875
all our forces
 across the continent are gone.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,666
Three hundred thousand

7
00:00:26,666 --> 00:00:29,375
undying knights… wiped out!

8
00:00:29,541 --> 00:00:31,250
The Godfather’s that powerful?

9
00:00:36,041 --> 00:00:38,625
They said he was
close to a god.

10
00:00:38,625 --> 00:00:40,250
I thought they were exaggerating.

11
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:43,541
One person shakes all 
of Golantis… is he a god?

12
00:00:43,541 --> 00:00:46,166
Even if he is
a god, I’ll kill him!

13
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:56,000
What now?

14
00:01:01,250 --> 00:01:02,541
My lord!

15
00:01:02,541 --> 00:01:05,750
All our Dark Knights in 
the North... they're all dead.

16
00:01:05,916 --> 00:01:09,250
The Wardens are 
too strong. I'm-

17
00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:10,541
Damn it!

18
00:01:11,250 --> 00:01:13,125
The Sovereign Sanctum is
stronger

19
00:01:13,125 --> 00:01:14,250
than I thought!

20
00:01:14,250 --> 00:01:15,375
What do we do now?

21
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:17,000
Do not panic.

22
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,916
I still have
one final trump card.

23
00:01:19,916 --> 00:01:21,875
Once I play it,

24
00:01:21,875 --> 00:01:25,750
even the Godfather will 
bow to me!

25
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:27,416
Oh?

26
00:01:27,875 --> 00:01:30,000
Then show me.
